BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Payloads</h1>
Atlantis in orbit with Carina in its payload bay: the payload's mass is
part of the orbiter's dynamics, and releasing it conserves momentum. The
released payload leaves the open bay without being pushed by collisions.
END_HYPERDESC

